choose-if: lejeune_jung_unlock
on-arrival: unionist_relation -= 5; concord_left += 3 if concord_ideology == "Right"; concord_right += 3 if concord_ideology == "Left"; burgher_unionist += 3; guild_unionist += 3; landed_unionist += 3; faithful_unionist += 5; faithful_dnf -= 3; commons_unionist -= 3; disfavored_unionist -= 3; concord_leader = "Lejeune-Jung"; concord_ideology = "Right"; guild_unionist = 25 if guild_unionist < 25; landed_unionist = 25 if landed_unionist < 25
face-image: img/portraits/lejeune_jung.jpg

Paul Lejeune-Jung, leader of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>'s Catholic wing, and an advocate for closer ties to the <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span> has been elected as leader of a merger between the two. His Catholic faith has made him acceptable to former <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span> members, and his alignment with Westmore's faction has solidified <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalist</span> support.

However, Lejeune-Jung's role as a compromise candidate has hindered his ability to effect significant change, as he must tread carefully to avoid alienating the factions that helped bring him to power. Lejeune-Jung will attempt to bridge the confessional divides between Catholic and Protestant conservatives, with the party still divided along the lines of their party of <span class="tooltip-text" title="that's me! the modman!">origin</span>.

It goes without saying, this will make cooperation within the party impossible for the foreseeable future.

@goerdeler
title: Carl Goodlake, formerly of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">Traditionalists</span>, is elected as their new leader.
subtitle: Goodlake is the Mayor of Leipzig, harbouring fiscally conservative views and a support of <span style="color: #808080;">monarchism</span>. - <span style="color: #0087DC;">People's Conservatives</span>
unavailable-subtitle: Goodlake is seen as too right-wing for the <span style="color: #0087DC;">Volkskonservativ</span> movement, who only begrudgingly supports his candidacy. - <span style="color: #0087DC;">People's Conservatives</span>
